  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention: Field Epidemiology and Laboratory Training Programs (FELTPs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) Field Epidemiology and Laboratory Training Programs (FELTPs) are applied epidemiology training programs offered by CDC to help countries develop, set up and implement dynamic public health strategies to improve and strengthen their public health systems and infrastructures.</narrative>
